Ubuntu Server 26.04 ZFS / LUKS / TPM installer and helper scripts

Source project:
https://github.com/FollowTheWizard/install-ubuntu-server-2604-zfs-luks-tpm

This distribution contains modified versions of the installer (based on
revision 9.0), verify.sh (based on revision 4), and samba-user.sh.
Changes are described in the source headers and README.md. They include
firewall setup changes, ZFS/LUKS boot ordering and degraded-boot handling,
EFI setup, verification fixes, Samba account handling fixes, and updated
English documentation and download/password instructions.

